r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n1. Create a component that uses `<textarea v-bind=\"$attrs\" />`\r\n2. Import it into VitePress\r\n3. Use the component in a `.md` file\r\n4. Build the docs\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nNo error to be thrown.\r\n\r\n(Not sure if this is an issue with the rollup plugin itself, but it seems fishy it only happens on one specific element).\r\n\r\n**System Info**\r\n- vitepress version: 0.12.2\r\n- vite version: 2.0.0-beta67\r\n- Node version: 12.19.0\r\n- OS version: 11.2.1\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nLet me know if I can assist more with this. I might be able to make a small reproduction over the weekend if it helps.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/vitepress/issues/244/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/vitepress/issues/244/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":4354070878,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDQzNTQwNzA4Nzg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/events/4354070878","actor":{"login":"posva","id":664177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NDE3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/664177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva","html_url":"https://github.com/posva","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/posva